@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Monospace
left to right direction
title tokencard/contracts - System Architecture

rectangle "Off-chain Clients" as Offchain {
  component "Integrator/Developer App" as App <<App>>
  component "Generated Go Bindings" as Bindings <<Library>>
  App --> Bindings : uses
}

node "Owner Address (EOA)" as Owner <<EOA>> {
  component "Gas Tank (ETH for gas payment)" as GasTank <<Balance>>
}

node "Ethereum Network" as EthNet {
  component "ENS" as ENS <<ENS Contract>>
  component "Consumer Contract Wallet" as Wallet <<Smart Contract>>
  component "Controller Contract" as Controller <<Smart Contract>>
  component "Token Whitelist Contract" as Whitelist <<Smart Contract>>
  component "Oracle/Rate Provider Contract" as Oracle <<Smart Contract>>
  component "TKN Holder Contract" as TknHolder <<Smart Contract>>
}

Owner --> Wallet : owns / controls
GasTank --> EthNet : gas for tx

Wallet ..> ENS : resolve Controller / Whitelist / Oracle addresses
Bindings ..> ENS : resolve contract addresses

' On-chain interactions among contracts
Wallet --> Controller : control / confirmation ops
Wallet ..> Whitelist : read token support, rates,\nloadability, burnability
Wallet ..> Oracle : get exchange-rate data
Wallet --> TknHolder : burn tokens (when allowed)

' Off-chain interactions via generated bindings
Bindings ..> Controller : Call: adminCount(),\ncontrollerCount()
Bindings --> Controller : Transact / Transfer (paid)
Bindings ..> Wallet : Call (read-only)
Bindings --> Wallet : Transact / Transfer (paid)
Bindings ..> Whitelist : Call: token rules / rates
Bindings ..> Oracle : Call: exchange-rate
Bindings --> TknHolder : Transact: burn (if permitted)

note right of Owner
Gas-payment ETH (Gas Tank) remains
outside the Consumer Contract Wallet
and its security protections.
end note

note right of ENS
ENS-based resolution is required
before interacting with supporting
contracts (Controller, Whitelist, Oracle).
end note

legend right
- Solid arrow: paid transaction (Transact / Transfer)
- Dashed arrow: read-only call or address resolution
endlegend
@enduml
